---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Blog of Even — research, engineering and learning notes." />
    <title>Blog of Even</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/">Blog of Even</a>
        <nav>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
          <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/wlh64113-cyber">GitHub</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section class="hero">
          <p class="eyebrow">Research · AI · Bioinformatics · Engineering</p>
          <h1>Hi, I’m Even.</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            这里记录我的科研、编程学习、论文阅读和项目实践。这个网站由 Astro 构建，并部署在 GitHub Pages。
          </p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button" href="/blog">Read the blog</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/wlh64113-cyber">View GitHub</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="projects">
          <h2>What I’m working on</h2>
          <div class="grid">
            <article class="card">
              <h3>Enzyme–Reaction Learning</h3>
              <p>酶与生化反应的联合表示、检索与多模态建模。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
              <h3>Protein Representation</h3>
              <p>蛋白序列、结构与文本模态的表示学习与融合。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
              <h3>Engineering Notes</h3>
              <p>Git、Linux、FastAPI、MySQL 与日常开发学习记录。</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
          <h2>Latest notes</h2>
          <div class="grid">
            <article class="card">
              <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p>
              <h3>Blog of Even is online</h3>
              <p>这是博客的第一版。后续会逐步加入 Markdown 文章、标签、论文阅读和项目页面。</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer>© 2026 Even · Built with Astro & GitHub Pages</footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
